dashed SESSION_PROCTOR - EXAM_INCIDENT line is a derived business relationship, not an FK.&lt;br&gt;Derived business relationship when the reporter is a proctor assigned to the session.&lt;br&gt;Not an FK: an incident does not store session_proctor_id. Automatic incidents or incidents&lt;br&gt;reported by others need no SESSION_PROCTOR; the reporter may also be absent." style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#64748b;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#e2e8f0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="2045" width="1100" height="116" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
